~ start
Marlow: [[Hi|Hello|Howdy]], nice to meet you!
Marlow: Welcome to your farm. Small, but the soil is good.
Marlow: I have turned over a patch for you already. The rest is up to you.
Marlow: Start with cabbage. It grows quickly and it forgives a beginner.
- Take the seeds
	Teemo: Thank you. Where do I start?
	Marlow: Four things, in this order.
	Marlow: The hoe on bare grass digs a new bed. That is how the farm grows.
	Marlow: The seeds on a dug bed plant a crop.
	Marlow: The watering can keeps it alive. Let the soil dry out and you lose weight at harvest.
	Marlow: When it stops growing, swing the hoe at it to bring it in.
	Marlow: Come find me when you have your first cabbage.
	do GameDialogueManager.action_give_crop_seeds()
- Not yet
	Teemo: I am not ready to start farming yet.
=> END
